OL,3,AFrench police lost control, says
OL,4,Ainterior minister, after weekend of
OL,5,Ariots and looting
OL,6,
OL,7,FFrench police "lost control" in some
OL,8,Fcities during a weekend of riots and
OL,9,Flooting, the country's interior
OL,10,Fminister says
OL,12,FLaurent Nunez says there was a "lack of
OL,13,Fanticipation" from police - he has
OL,14,Foffered to resign, but French President
OL,15,FEmmanuel Macron wants him to stay
OL,17,FThe disorder began last month with
OL,18,Fstudents protesting over school
OL,19,Fconditions, but have since escalated to
OL,20,Ftake in a broader range of concerns
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
