OL,3,AFrench police lost control, says
OL,4,Ainterior minister, after weekend of
OL,5,Ariots and looting
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than half a million people took to
OL,8,Fthe streets on Saturday - but protests
OL,9,Fturned violent in some places, with
OL,10,Fbuildings set on fire and shops looted
OL,12,FSome disorder continued on Sunday - in
OL,13,FParis, police arrested more than 350
OL,14,Fpeople, with at least five shops
OL,15,Flooted. The justice minister says the
OL,16,Fsecurity service is "not tackling the
OL,17,Ffar-left effectively"
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
